- Vertical spacing: 120px between nodes
- Keep x values: data=50, logic=280, component=520
- Keep y values starting at 80, increment by 120

## Rules
- Always output ONLY valid JSON, no markdown, no explanation
- Use Korean for labels and descriptions
- Generate meaningful, connected node graphs
- data nodes feed into logic nodes feed into component nodes
